Company's strategy is to provide our customers with comprehensive design capabilities, a broad selection of products and a high level of quality and service on a worldwide basis, while maintaining continuing programs of productivity improvement and cost control. The Company aligns its businesses into three reportable business segments: (i) Communications Solutions, (ii) Harsh Environment Solutions and (iii) Interconnect and Sensor Systems. This alignment and segment structure reinforces the Company's entrepreneurial culture and enables clear accountability of each of our business unit general managers, while enhancing the scalability of Amphenol's business for the future. The Company has three segment managers who lead their respective reportable business segments, each reporting directly to the Company's Chief Executive Officer. All segment information throughout this Annual Report ","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"The Company sells products to customers in a diversified set of end markets. For a discussion of certain risks related to the Company's end markets, refer to the subsection titled \"Risks Related to our End Markets\" included in Part I,","zh":null}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Communications Solutions","val":12160600000,"zh":"Communications Solutions"},{"name":"Harsh Environment Solutions","val":6001900000,"zh":"Harsh Environment Solutions"},{"name":"Interconnect & Sensor Systems","val":5216100000,"zh":"Interconnect & Sensor Systems"}],"total":23094700000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Other Foreign Locations","val":11433900000,"zh":"Other Foreign Locations"},{"name":"US","val":7987700000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":3673100000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":23094700000}},"peers":["TEL","AME","CDNS","PWR","ANET"]}}